[h2]Build 0.9.11[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]Conveyor arms have [b]Reverse[/b] and [b]Rotate[/b] buttons to turn them where they stand; conveyor lifts have [b]Rotate output[/b].
[*]A Loader with nothing to send now says why: its storage is empty, or what the machine thinks of the first item in it (for the SloppyMods repair center, for example "not damaged" or "not in the accepted gear filter"), so you can see which setting to change.
[/list]
